<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Diffusion on Best of AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tags/diffusion/</link><description>Recent content in Diffusion on Best of AI</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bestofai.io/tags/diffusion/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Stable Diffusion 4</title><link>https://bestofai.io/models/stable-diffusion-4/</link><pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/models/stable-diffusion-4/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Stable Diffusion 4 is Stability AI&amp;rsquo;s first major update to the line since SD 3.5 in late 2024, growing the model to 12 billion parameters and sharpening prompt adherence and text rendering inside images, both long-standing weak points against closed competitors like Midjourney and Imagen. It&amp;rsquo;s released under the same Stability AI Community License as SD 3.5, free for individuals and small companies, with paid licensing required above a revenue threshold.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>FLUX</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/flux/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/flux/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Stable Diffusion</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/stable-diffusion/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/stable-diffusion/</guid><description/></item><item><title>FLUX.1 dev</title><link>https://bestofai.io/models/flux-1-dev/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/models/flux-1-dev/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;FLUX.1 dev is the open-weight tier of Black Forest Labs&amp;rsquo; FLUX image generation family, released in August 2024 alongside the closed FLUX.1 Pro. Black Forest Labs was founded by former Stability AI researchers, including some of the people behind the original Stable Diffusion, and FLUX uses a 12 billion parameter rectified flow transformer architecture rather than the U-Net diffusion designs common in earlier text-to-image models. Dev is a guidance-distilled version of the full Pro model, which makes it faster to run while keeping most of the image quality and prompt adherence of its closed sibling. Black Forest Labs licenses it for non-commercial use only, distributing the weights on Hugging Face, while companies that want to use it commercially need to buy a separate license through BFL. It quickly became one of the most widely fine-tuned and remixed open image models after release, with strong adoption on platforms like Replicate and in the Stable Diffusion community&amp;rsquo;s tooling such as ComfyUI.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>FLUX.1 Pro</title><link>https://bestofai.io/models/flux-1-pro/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/models/flux-1-pro/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;FLUX.1 Pro is the flagship, closed-weight model in Black Forest Labs&amp;rsquo; FLUX family, released in August 2024 alongside the open FLUX.1 dev and schnell tiers. It&amp;rsquo;s a 12 billion parameter rectified flow transformer, the largest and highest-quality version in the lineup, available only through Black Forest Labs&amp;rsquo; own API and hosting partners such as Replicate and fal.ai rather than as downloadable weights. Black Forest Labs was founded in 2024 by researchers who previously built Stable Diffusion at Stability AI, and FLUX quickly became one of the strongest text-to-image models for prompt adherence, typography, and image composition, competing with Midjourney and OpenAI&amp;rsquo;s image models. Pricing is usage-based per generated image rather than a flat subscription, aimed at developers building image generation into products rather than casual end users. Since the initial release, Black Forest Labs has layered additional Pro-tier capabilities on top, including the Kontext editing models, while keeping FLUX.1 Pro as the general-purpose flagship for straight text-to-image generation.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Stable Diffusion 3.5</title><link>https://bestofai.io/models/stable-diffusion-3-5/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/models/stable-diffusion-3-5/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Stable Diffusion XL</title><link>https://bestofai.io/models/stable-diffusion-xl/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/models/stable-diffusion-xl/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Muse Image</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/meta-muse-image/</link><pubDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/meta-muse-image/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Nano Banana Pro</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/nano-banana-pro/</link><pubDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/nano-banana-pro/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Gencraft</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/gencraft/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/gencraft/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Stockcake</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/stockcake/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/stockcake/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Artbreeder</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/artbreeder/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/artbreeder/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Civitai</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/civitai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/civitai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>ComfyUI</title><link>https://bestofai.i